{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","language":"zh-CN","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-43","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-43-talk-403815112-line","text":"你遇到了一个机械生命，它似乎对奇物修理颇有理解。","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-43-talk-403815114-line","text":"它示意你将在乎的宝贝丢给它进行修理。","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-43-text-673974022335536802-choice","text":"向无机生命表示友好。","speaker":""},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-43-text-8072431745826656662-choice","text":"进行一次愉快的无机交流！","speaker":""},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-43-text-6252097084963829918-choice","text":"修理一个损毁的奇物。","speaker":""},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-43-text-6738987606115192926-choice","text":"修理全部损毁的奇物。","speaker":""},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-43-text-13545507220346782516-choice","text":"离开。","speaker":""},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-43-text-12706601695007720461-effect","text":"你不需要。","speaker":""}]}
